    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc96 ADD OUR GAMES TO YOUR WISHLIST \ud83d\udc96</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597000/extras/cad06fc41403ffc9f6022411bd620695.avif?t=1754919928\" width=616 height=224 /></span></p></p><br><h1>\ud83d\udd25HOT MILFS ARE WAITING FOR YOU!!! \ud83d\udd25 \u2764\ufe0fTAKE YOUR PLACE, THEY WON'T WAIT FOREVER!! \u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udd25</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597000/extras/daa735868f3773a2400950bb3126d812.avif?t=1754919928\" width=616 height=199 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597000/extras/84f95a0eba9ff5c6b06e9d6edf4d433d.avif?t=1754919928\" width=614 height=326 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Umbranomicon</strong> is more than just a visual novel, it's an entire elaborate world with its own story, JRPG and animated dating simulator. You'll find yourself in the magical world of the kingdom of Lumindor, which was on the verge of collapse after the sly and narcissistic Queen Nox cast a curse, turning all men into evil dwarves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597000/extras/f42126f90721da25a56cbc7dc932eaa8.avif?t=1754919928\" width=614 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your role is as the chosen hero, summoned by the local ruler Umbra to save Lumindor and its beautiful inhabitants from the impending darkness. You will have to set out on dangerous and exciting adventures, uncover secrets and win the hearts of the girls, each of whom has a distinctive character and unique appearance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dive into this rich world of adventure:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the picturesque and mysterious corners of Lumindor, fight enemies using a dynamic combat system that is based on reaction and speed. Earn gold, purchase gifts and gain trust of beautiful heroines by unlocking the secrets of their hearts and gaining access to hot and seductive scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597000/extras/53c3488f0598b73ca7d9f215ac5778d0.avif?t=1754919928\" width=614 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25cf 6 adorable female characters: each has her own unique style, temperament, and personal story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25cf Animated H-scenes: realistic and exciting, available for repeat viewing at any time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25cf Original combat mechanic: fight enemies in a fast and exciting mode that tests your reactions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25cf Interactive dialog and dating system: every your words influence the development of relationships and unlock new storylines.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25cf Mini-games and side quests: enhance your playthrough and earn valuable rewards.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25cf Comprehensive and detailed world: divided into different regions with unique locations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597000/extras/c2df5689ee7cb9cc7cf35582a2456847.avif?t=1754919928\" width=614 height=213 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597000/extras/84f95a0eba9ff5c6b06e9d6edf4d433d.avif?t=1754919928\" width=614 height=326 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Umbranomicon</strong> is more than just a visual novel, it's an entire elaborate world with its own story, JRPG and animated dating simulator. You'll find yourself in the magical world of the kingdom of Lumindor, which was on the verge of collapse after the sly and narcissistic Queen Nox cast a curse, turning all men into evil dwarves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597000/extras/f42126f90721da25a56cbc7dc932eaa8.avif?t=1754919928\" width=614 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your role is as the chosen hero, summoned by the local ruler Umbra to save Lumindor and its beautiful inhabitants from the impending darkness. You will have to set out on dangerous and exciting adventures, uncover secrets and win the hearts of the girls, each of whom has a distinctive character and unique appearance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dive into this rich world of adventure:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the picturesque and mysterious corners of Lumindor, fight enemies using a dynamic combat system that is based on reaction and speed. Earn gold, purchase gifts and gain trust of beautiful heroines by unlocking the secrets of their hearts and gaining access to hot and seductive scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597000/extras/53c3488f0598b73ca7d9f215ac5778d0.avif?t=1754919928\" width=614 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25cf 6 adorable female characters: each has her own unique style, temperament, and personal story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25cf Animated H-scenes: realistic and exciting, available for repeat viewing at any time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25cf Original combat mechanic: fight enemies in a fast and exciting mode that tests your reactions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25cf Interactive dialog and dating system: every your words influence the development of relationships and unlock new storylines.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25cf Mini-games and side quests: enhance your playthrough and earn valuable rewards.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25cf Comprehensive and detailed world: divided into different regions with unique locations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597000/extras/c2df5689ee7cb9cc7cf35582a2456847.avif?t=1754919928\" width=614 height=213 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Umbranomicon is a full immersive experience! Because you get two in one: a VN and a fully animated dating simulator. You will have to dive into a mystical world of dangerous adventures to fight the Queen of Darkness and meet a lot of lonely girls, because men are extinct.",
